tests/fixtures contains excerpts of adsb.lol data under the ODbL 1.0. These excerpts remain in the repository only in
anonymised form: aircraft addresses are replaced by fake addresses, and callsigns, squawk codes, registrations and type
codes are removed. Positions carry a fixed offset and are not suitable for any analysis.

